# GMS states no clock for this, and there is none in the data to find: the
# summon's attack info carries a hit count and a reach but no interval, so the
# cadence is a constant the client holds for the whole family of old summons.
# Timed off a video of it playing at no more than once every 3 seconds, which
# is where Fiel's older measurement of the whole family put it too.
#
# One enemy and one strike, which is what makes it a modest skill: the eye
# roams and picks its own target rather than joining the shout.
name: "Evil Eye of Domination"
description: "Your Evil Eye roams freely, attacking nearby enemies."
kind: SKILL_KIND_AUTO_ATTACK
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_BERSERKER skill_order: 3 }
max_level: 10
max_enemies: 1
lines: 1
cast_interval_seconds: 3.0
base { skill_pct: 1.56 }
per_level { skill_pct: 0.06 }
